# src/infrastructure/

The outer adapter layer. Implements ports defined in `domain/` and `application/`.

- `persistence/` — ORM-backed repositories (Prisma, TypeORM, Mongoose)
- `web/` — NestJS controllers and module wiring
- `messaging/` — Kafka/RabbitMQ publishers

**Rule:** Infrastructure depends on `application/ports/` and `domain/repositories/`,
but never the reverse. Infrastructure is the only layer that knows about
NestJS controllers, ORM entities, and message brokers.
